        <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-6 py-16 md:px-24 md:py-24"><div class="grid items-start gap-x-6 gap-y-16 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-16"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">1. User Interviews</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#626975]">- Conducted in-depth user interviews with prospective parents to uncover their needs, challenges, and behaviors related to stunting prevention.<br> - Observed that users require a solution that is not only informative but also empathetic and user-friendly. This insight became the strategic foundation for prioritizing a supportive community feature and a simplified tracking dashboard in the final UI/UX design.</p><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/interview (2).png') }}" alt="Genpro user interviews"></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">3. User Persona</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#626975]">- Developed the Nutria user persona, a 25-year-old midwife, based on user research to represent the primary target audience of Genpro Apps.<br> - Identified Nutria's key pain points, including confusion from unstructured information and a lack of personalized features for tracking child development. <br>- Observed that Nutria needs a solution that is not only informative but also efficient—leading to the strategic decision to prioritize visual educational content (videos) and personalized notifications in the UI/UX design.</p><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/User Persona (2).png') }}" alt="Genpro user persona"></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">5. Prioritization Matrix</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#626975]">- Used a Prioritisation Matrix with an Impact vs. Effort model to evaluate the collected solution ideas.<br>- The main goal was to identify the core features for the MVP (Minimum Viable Product), which are the features that deliver the highest user impact with the most efficient development effort. <br>- Prioritized "Quick Wins" such as health reminder and hygiene guidance features for the initial release, while "Big Bets" like infographics and educational videos were planned for development in later phases.</p><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/priority matrks.png') }}" alt="Genpro prioritization matrix"></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">7. Wireframe</h2><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/wireframe.png') }}" alt="Genpro wireframe"></div></div><div class="space-y-16"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">2. Competitor Analysis</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#626975]">- Analyzed key competitors such as Mamanesia and PrimaKu to pinpoint successful features, market gaps, and design approaches.<br>- Observed that existing applications do not fully address user needs for a supportive community and personalized, easy-to-understand educational content.</p><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/competitor analys.png') }}" alt="Genpro competitor analysis"></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">4. Solution Idea</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#626975]">- Conducted an ideation session based on HMW (How Might We) statements formulated from user research findings.<br> - Generated a range of solution ideas focusing on two key challenges: (1) Providing easy-to-understand stunting prevention features and (2) Ensuring the app is responsive and accessible even in areas with unstable internet connections. <br> - Compiled a list of potential feature ideas, such as a growth journal, expert consultations, and an offline mode. These ideas will be evaluated in the next prioritization phase.</p><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/solution idea.png') }}" alt="Genpro solution ideas"></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">6. User Flow</h2><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/wireframe.png') }}" alt="Genpro user flow"></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#3157ff]">8. Prototyping</h2><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/prototype.png') }}" alt="Genpro prototype"></div></div></div><div class="mt-16"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">High-Fidelity Designs</h2><img class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl" src="{{ asset('images/portfolio/genpro/High fidelity.png') }}" alt="Genpro high fidelity designs"></div></section>
